---
description: Operations agents must not perform without explicit approval
alwaysApply: true
---

Human-only unless the current request explicitly approves the action:

- production secrets, form-backend credentials, or client-side API keys
- domain / DNS / GitHub Pages settings
- production deployment or claiming the live site is updated
- public investor financial claims or data-room files
- legal-policy publication
- analytics provider changes
- Website 2.0 architecture migration
- publishing unconfirmed company email addresses
- merging to main without an explicit merge request
